{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116896","id":3339047097,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HBdC5","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116896","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116896.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116896.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116896","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116896/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116896/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116896/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1e8c94784e0b57fca8d93b57ab5245fff81032bd","number":116896,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix project save crash","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #116431\r\n\r\n**Description:**\r\nWhen creating or opening a project in a directory protected by OS-level security (such as Windows Defender Controlled Folder Access), `ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->save()` returns an `ERR_UNAUTHORIZED` (or similar file I/O error). \r\n\r\nPreviously, during `NOTIFICATION_READY` in `editor_node.cpp`, this return value was ignored. The engine would swallow the error and continue the boot sequence without a valid `project.godot` file or accessible `.godot/` cache directory. This resulted in a static editor state, leading to a massive cascade of file-access errors and eventual segfaults when trying to write filesystem caches or script documentation upon exit.\r\n\r\n**The Fix:**\r\nAdded a check to capture the `Error` returned by the initial `ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->save()`. If the save fails (`!= OK`), the engine now intercepts the failure, triggers a native `OS::get_singleton()->alert()` to explicitly warn the user about folder permissions/antivirus blocking, and immediately calls `get_tree()->quit()` to cleanly abort the initialization before the editor can enter a corrupted state.\r\n\r\n**Testing:**\r\n- Enabled Windows Defender Controlled Folder Access.\r\n- Attempted to open a project in a protected directory.\r\n- Verified that the editor correctly halts, displays the native OS error dialog, and exits cleanly with code 0 upon acknowledgment, preventing any cascading cache errors.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-28T16:53:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-01T14:51:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merg